I put up PR with  fix but that is unlikely to meet servicing bar for 8.0 @codecat. 
another workaround would be something like 
```c#
using var readerReg = ct.Register(() =>
{
    var s = new Socket(new SafeSocketHandle(client.SafePipeHandle.DangerousGetHandle (), ownsHandle: false));
    s.Shutdown(SocketShutdown.Both);
    reader.Close();
});
```
